# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# go_router (browser history mode) owns deep-link routes like /assets,
# /transactions/new, /analytics/equity. Pages serves matching static files
# first, so this rule only fires for paths that don't resolve to a real file
# — i.e. SPA routes — and rewrites them to the bootstrap shell with a 200.
#
# Hashed assets (main.dart.js, *.part.js, canvaskit/*) match real files and
# are served directly with no rewrite, so this is safe.
/*    /index.html   200
